// ---- Circuit (Kit 4) ----
// TCRT5000: VCC 5V, GND, DO -> D13 (HIGH over a dark surface / no surface), AO -> A0 (higher = darker)
// Green LED anode -> 220 ohm -> D5 (PWM), cathode -> GND
